<h1><%= @article.title %></h1>
<p><%= @article.content %></p>
<p>
  <%= link_to "Ver comentarios", article_comments_path(@article) %>
</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Volver", root_path %>
</p>



<%# 
Cuando se anida 'resources', Rails arma URLs que incluyen article_id.
1. article_comments_path(article) -> GET /articles/:article_id/comments -> comments#index

2. article_comment_path(article, comment) -> GET /articles/:article_id/comments/:id -> comments#show

3. new_article_comment_path(article) -> GET /articles/:article_id/comments/new -> comments#new

 %>